aquinas-first-way.logic.r3: argue/scope: A1: read with the necessity on its consequent alone, moved_potential ∧ mover_actual → □(self_motion → same_act_pot), the argument holds; read with it on the whole conditional, □(moved_potential ∧ mover_actual → (self_motion → same_act_pot)), C1 (S9) does not follow: it needs the necessity of the consequent, not only of the consequence, and which the sentence means decides the argument
